    }
  ],
  "notes": "FORMS:\n{粘|ねば}り (stickiness) + {強|づよ}い (strong)\n\nThe image is of something sticky that won't let go.\n- {粘|ねば}り{強|づよ}くない - not tenacious (negative)\n- {粘|ねば}り{強|づよ}くて - tenacious and... (te-form)\n- {粘|ねば}り{強|づよ}かった - was tenacious (past)\n- {粘|ねば}り{強|づよ}く + verb - tenaciously (adverb)\n- {粘|ねば}り{強|づよ}さ - tenacity (noun)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {粘|ねば}り{強|づよ}く{交渉|こうしょう}する - to negotiate persistently\n- {粘|ねば}り{強|づよ}く{説得|せっとく}する - to persuade persistently\n- {粘|ねば}り{強|づよ}い{努力|どりょく} - persistent effort\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {我慢強|がまんづよ}い - patient, enduring (emphasizes bearing hardship)\n- しつこい - persistent (often negative)\n- {諦|あきら}めない - not giving up",
